00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:46.780
And I think that they got into this whole, like, system of the waking world and the dream world basically being mirrors of each other.

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:59.920
And then, you know, I guess one might expect that after that kind of decision, you would get to, well, the dream world has to be, like, higher stakes.

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:06.120
